---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Flamingo - Flamingo Paper Products, Inc."
  description="For nearly 50 years, Flamingo Paper Products have designed and manufactured the best bathroom tissue on the market. Doubled layered, soft, strong, and highly absorbent."
>
  <div class="container page-container">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li class="breadcrumb-separator">/</li>
      <li class="breadcrumb-current" aria-current="page">About Flamingo</li>
    </nav>

    <div class="about-hero-section">
      <div class="about-text-content">
        <h1 class="page-title">About Flamingo</h1>
        <p class="lead-paragraph">
          For nearly 50 years, Flamingo Paper Products have designed and manufactured the best bathroom tissue on the market. Doubled layered, soft, strong, and highly absorbent, Flamingo Bathroom Tissue is a technologically advanced premium brand. We are committed to producing the highest quality bathroom tissue at the greatest value.
        </p>

        <div class="about-highlights">
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <span class="highlight-stat">1965</span>
            <span class="highlight-label">Year Founded</span>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <span class="highlight-stat">50+</span>
            <span class="highlight-label">Years of Manufacturing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <span class="highlight-stat">100%</span>
            <span class="highlight-label">Septic &amp; Sewer Safe</span>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <span class="highlight-stat">2-Ply</span>
            <span class="highlight-label">Double Layered Quality</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-image-wrapper">
        <img
          src="/flamingo-manufacturing-1500w.jpg"
          alt="Flamingo Paper Products Manufacturing Facility"
          width="1500"
          height="800"
          class="about-img"
          loading="eager"
        />
        <p class="image-caption">Flamingo Paper Products, Inc. State-of-the-Art Production Facility</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Company Story & Principles -->
    <div class="about-details-grid">
      <div class="details-card">
        <h2>Our Commitment to Quality</h2>
        <p>
          At Flamingo Paper Products, our philosophy is simple: never compromise on comfort or durability. Every roll of Flamingo Bathroom Tissue undergoes strict quality testing to ensure unmatched softness without sacrificing essential tensile strength.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="details-card">
        <h2>Eco-Advanced Technology</h2>
        <p>
          We employ technologically and ecologically advanced processing methods to create tissue that dissolves quickly and safely. Safe for all residential septic tanks, recreational vehicles, boats, and municipal systems.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="details-card">
        <h2>American Heritage &amp; Value</h2>
        <p>
          Headquartered in the City of Industry, California, Flamingo Tissue provides families and commercial institutions with bulk and packaged tissue solutions that offer 10% to 50% more sheets per roll than leading supermarket brands.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-cta-box">
      <h3>Interested in partnering with us?</h3>
      <p>Connect with our management and sales representatives for wholesale accounts and institutional purchasing.</p>
      <div class="cta-btns">
        <a href="/wholesale" class="btn btn-primary">Wholesale Inquiries</a>
        <a href="/mgt" class="btn btn-outline">Meet Management</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .about-hero-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #2c2c2c;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-highlights {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--primary-light-pink);
    border: 1px solid rgba(194, 0, 108, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .highlight-stat {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--primary-dark-pink);
  }

  .highlight-label {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #555;
  }

  .about-image-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .about-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    max-height: 550px;
  }

  .image-caption {
    background-color: #f3f4f6;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #666;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-details-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .details-card {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .details-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--primary-pink);
  }

  .details-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .details-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .contact-cta-box {
    background: #fafafa;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-cta-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-cta-box p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-btns {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-highlights {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .about-details-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-highlights {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .lead-paragraph {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
